{"pr":188,"result":{"status":"fulfilled","value":{"chunk_id":"8a9f3a","wall_time_seconds":0.581151458,"exit_code":0,"original_token_count":1989,"output":"{\"baseRefOid\":\"4f572fbb5f6c6da51503cf259381823acab06dd9\",\"body\":\"## Release Preview\\n\\nThis automated PR was generated by [Callisto](https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto). Merging this PR will publish the updated packages to their release targets.\\n\\n### 📊 Release Summary\\n\\n| Package | Ecosystem | Current | Target | Bump | Reason |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| `callisto-cli` | `core` | `0.10.0` | **`0.10.1`** | 🟢 `patch` | Changeset (`brave-cheetahs-dash`) |\\n| `callisto-fixtures` | `core` | `0.10.0` | **`0.10.1`** | 🟢 `patch` | Fixed group `workspace` |\\n| `callisto-graph` | `core` | `0.10.0` | **`0.10.1`** | 🟢 `patch` | Fixed group `workspace` |\\n| `callisto-manifests` | `core` | `0.10.0` | **`0.10.1`** | 🟢 `patch` | Fixed group `workspace` |\\n| `callisto-model` | `core` | `0.10.0` | **`0.10.1`** | 🟢 `patch` | Fixed group `workspace` |\\n\\n> [!NOTE]\\n> **5 package(s)** queued for versioning. All changes are backward compatible.\\n\\n### 📦 What's Changing\\n\\n_Also bumped with no direct change of their own (released together via a fixed/linked group): `callisto-fixtures`, `callisto-graph`, `callisto-manifests`, `callisto-model`._\\n\\n**12 change(s) across 5 package(s):**\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary><b>`brave-cheetahs-dash`</b> — affects <code>callisto-cli</code></summary>\\n\\nGenerated npm and PyPI releases configure native registry authentication for publishing without exposing credentials to Python build backends.\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary><b>`calm-lions-surge`</b> — affects <code>callisto-cli</code></summary>\\n\\nGitHub Actions honor requested Callisto versions; building checkout source requires source: local.\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary><b>`complete-lock-targets`</b> — affects <code>callisto-cli</code></summary>\\n\\nVersioning refreshes and stages lockfiles for every package manifest and dependency declaration it updates, including dual Cargo and npm packages.\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary><b>`historical-release-authority`</b> — affects <code>callisto-cli</code></summary>\\n\\nRelease decisions verify effective package versions from the selected commit, including versions inherited from Cargo workspace metadata, and only treat direct-child changeset Markdown files (excluding README.md) as consumed changesets.\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary><b>`lively-dolphins-climb`</b> — affects <code>callisto-cli</code></summary>\\n\\nInterrupted version runs retain release inputs until generated changes and their removal are safely staged, prevent unsafe retries, and explain how to inspect staged work and finish recovery.\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary><b>`native-dependency-names`</b> — affects <code>callisto-cli</code></summary>\\n\\nVersion and snapshot updates recognize Cargo aliases and equivalent Python distribution names while preserving dependency declaration spelling.\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary><b>`native-json-schema`</b> — affects <code>callisto-cli</code></summary>\\n\\nCLI JSON schemas accurately describe the string values emitted for versions, package identities, and digests.\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary><b>`native-prerelease-baselines`</b> — affects <code>callisto-cli</code></summary>\\n\\nPre-release baselines are validated using each package's native version syntax, including when packages share a name or have been promoted to ecosystem-qualified ids.\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary><b>`pnpm-workspace-ranges`</b> — affects <code>callisto-cli</code></summary>\\n\\nnpm version ranges with `||` alternatives are understood for dependency coverage; pnpm workspace aliases, relative references and explicit ranges are resolved and updated without changing their protocol or dependency names.\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary><b>`python-release-versions`</b> — affects <code>callisto-cli</code></summary>\\n\\nDurable release plans read Python package versions using PEP 440 semantics.\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary><b>`supported-cargo-artifacts`</b> — affects <code>callisto-cli</code></summary>\\n\\nGenerated artifact workflows include every supported Cargo binary; npm and Python executables remain registry releases unless a custom workflow builds their artifacts. `callisto init` now reports E304 when an npm or Python executable is chosen as the product package, and suggests `--no-workflow` for a registry-only release.\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary><b>`vivid-bears-hunt`</b> — affects <code>callisto-cli</code></summary>\\n\\nAutomated release PRs can refresh using generated decisions without rejecting their own branch updates.\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary><b>Release Workflow Instructions</b></summary>\\n\\n- **Merging this PR**: Merging into `main` will automatically publish all updated packages to their release registries.\\n- **Adding more changesets**: If additional changesets are pushed to `main`, Callisto will automatically re-calculate and update this PR.\\n- **Manual edits**: You can make manual adjustments directly on the `main` branch if needed.\\n\\n</details>\",\"commits\":[{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-14T02:35:28Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com\",\"id\":\"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=\",\"login\":\"github-actions[bot]\",\"name\":\"github-actions[bot]\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-14T02:35:28Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"chore(release): version packages\",\"oid\":\"da4c8468bac0d4ecc4e7c6874024419f9c977141\"}],\"files\":[{\"path\":\".callisto/release-decision.json\",\"additions\":6,\"deletions\":6,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\".changeset/brave-cheetahs-dash.md\",\"additions\":0,\"deletions\":5,\"changeType\":\"DELETED\"},{\"path\":\".changeset/calm-lions-surge.md\",\"additions\"